		{"id":"ff39fd3ce19c8c28","type":"text","text":"[[Old Lumiere.canvas]]\n#RavenLoft ","x":-600,"y":-400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"506ee3a8f26919a8","type":"text","text":"Once a storage cellar then turned into a secret research facility of Ravina Lumiere once both her parents went missing.\n\nFirst actual room a letter on a podium with the words.\n\n\"Prove you are potential, prove you know what you are for only who knows that they are not of their creation may reveal the way. Are you a decider or one who fate chooses for, show your fait in blood.\"\n\nAfter Aralia puts her blood into the cauldron a glyph will appear on the ground that everyone needs to step on to transport to a different location.\n\n\n\n\n\nIn the next room waiting is a Death knight and yes the real deal this mist finder aint coming easy…… The Fucking Death Knight is Vax\n\n\n","x":-600,"y":-280,"width":761,"height":354},
		{"id":"06855ee89c4d7d01","type":"text","text":"After defeating the death night they will get a mist talisman in the form of a key that will guide them to Koraki Kastro.\n\n\n\n","x":-600,"y":140,"width":520,"height":80},
